#: pla-site.toml:[cat_comments.default]
msgctxt "default_with_items"
msgid ""
"Here are listed $COUNT programs (including $ITEM_COUNT metapackage items) "
"for this category"
msgstr ""
"Qui sono elencati $COUNT programmi (inclusi $ITEM_COUNT elementi "
"metapackage) per questa categoria"

#: pla-site.toml:[cat_comments.default]
msgctxt "default_no_items"
msgid "Here are listed $COUNT programs for this category"
msgstr "Qui sono elencati $COUNT programmi per questa categoria"

#: pla-site.toml:[cat_comments.portable]
msgctxt "portable"
msgid ""
"Here are listed $COUNT command line utilities: static and dynamic ELF "
"binaries, or simple scripts"
msgstr ""
"Qui sono elencate $COUNT utilità da riga di comando: binari ELF statici e "
"dinamici, o semplici script"

#: pla-site.toml:[cat_comments.portable-desktop]
msgctxt "portable-desktop"
msgid ""
"Here are listed $COUNT desktop applications NOT in AppImage format. "
"Launchers and icons are downloaded separately during the installation "
"process (through <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/AM\">AM</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/AppMan\">AppMan</a>). Most of them already "
"have all the necessary requirements to be easily exported into AppImage "
"packages... or they are waiting to be moved to another category (see <a "
"href=\"appimage-on-the-fly.html\">AppImages on-the-fly</a>)"
msgstr ""
"Qui sono elencate $COUNT applicazioni desktop NON in formato AppImage. I "
"lanciatori e le icone vengono scaricate separatamente durante il processo di "
"installazione (attraverso <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/AM\">AM</a> e "
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/AppMan\">AppMan</a>). La maggior parte "
"di esse ha già tutti i requisiti necessari per essere facilmente esportate "
"in pacchetti AppImage... oppure stanno aspettando di essere spostate in "
"un'altra categoria (vedi <a href=\"appimage-on-the-fly.html\">AppImages on-"
"the-fly</a>)"

#: pla-site.toml:[cat_comments.am-utils]
msgctxt "am-utils"
msgid ""
"Here are listed $COUNT static binaries built for <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/ivan-hc/AM\">AM</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/"
"AppMan\">AppMan</a> which can be used as a fallback in case the system does "
"not have them"
msgstr ""
"Qui sono elencati $COUNT binari statici compilati per <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/ivan-hc/AM\">AM</a> e <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/"
"AppMan\">AppMan</a> che possono essere usati come alternativa nel caso il "
"sistema non li abbia"

#: pla-site.toml:[cat_comments.appimages]
msgctxt "appimages"
msgid ""
"Here are listed the $COUNT unique Appimages managed by <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/ivan-hc/AM\">AM</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/"
"AppMan\">AppMan</a>"
msgstr ""
"Qui sono elencati i $COUNT AppImage unici gestiti da <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/ivan-hc/AM\">AM</a> e <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/"
"AppMan\">AppMan</a>"

#: pla-site.toml:[cat_comments.metapackages]
msgctxt "metapackages"
msgid ""
"Here are listed $SUITE_COUNT \"metapackages\" (along with their $ITEM_COUNT "
"items), those few scripts that allow the use of many more programs with one "
"installation. Find which metapackage corresponds to the program you're "
"interested in from this list"
msgstr ""
"Qui sono elencati $SUITE_COUNT \"metapackages\" (insieme ai loro $ITEM_COUNT "
"elementi), quei pochi script che permettono l'uso di molti più programmi con "
"una sola installazione. Trova quale metapackage corrisponde al programma che "
"ti interessa da questa lista"

#: pla-site.toml:[cat_comments.appimage-on-the-fly]
msgctxt "appimage-on-the-fly"
msgid ""
"Here are listed $COUNT AppImages (including $ITEM_COUNT metapackage items) "
"built on the fly from the official portable builds, showing how easily "
"portable apps can be converted to AppImages to gain isolated dotfiles, "
"sandboxing via AM and AppMan, and reduced disk usage, serving as a proof of "
"concept to encourage upstream developers to distribute them directly in such "
"packaging format. Powered by <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/"
"portable2appimage\">portable2appimage</a>"
msgstr ""
"Qui sono elencati $COUNT AppImages (inclusi $ITEM_COUNT elementi "
"metapackage) costruiti al volo dalle build portabili ufficiali, mostrando "
"quanto sia facile convertire le app portabili in AppImage per ottenere "
"dotfiles isolati, sandboxing tramite AM e AppMan, e ridotto utilizzo di "
"disco, servendo come prova di concetto per incoraggiare gli sviluppatori "
"upstream a distribuirli direttamente in tale formato di packaging. "
"Realizzato da <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/"
"portable2appimage\">portable2appimage</a>"
